		"Status filter" => "Filtre d'estat",
		"Reschedule cron event" => "Reprogramar esdeveniment cron",
		"Change when the event runs next. For recurring events, pick the interval. Useful for orphaned events from deactivated plugins." => "Canvia quan s'executarà l'esdeveniment. Per a esdeveniments recurrents, tria l'interval. Útil per a esdeveniments orfes de plugins desactivats.",
		"Next run (local time)" => "Propera execució (hora local)",
