		"Drag tabs to reorder and move them between categories, drag into Favorites, and reorder favorites. Click ✕ on a tool to hide it or on a favorite to remove it." => "Arrossega pestanyes per reordenar-les i moure-les entre categories, arrossega-les a Preferits i reordena preferits. Fes clic a ✕ en una eina per amagar-la o en un preferit per eliminar-lo.",
		"No thumbnails" => "Sense miniatures",
		"Note: scans up to 100 recent posts/pages whose content contains a [ character. Numeric-only tags like [5196] are ignored. Shortcodes from MU-plugins or late-registered plugins may still appear as false positives." => "Nota: analitza fins a 100 entrades/pàgines recents amb [ al contingut. S'ignoren etiquetes només numèriques com [5196]. Shortcodes de MU-plugins o plugins registrats tard poden donar falsos positius.",
