		"Submitted too quickly or the form expired. Please wait a few seconds and try again." => "Enviament massa ràpid o formulari caducat. Espereu uns segons i torneu-ho a provar.",
		"Too many submissions from your IP address. Please try again later." => "Massa enviaments des de la vostra adreça IP. Torneu-ho a provar més tard.",
