		"Action on spam" => "Acció davant del spam",
		"Mark as spam" => "Marcar com a spam",
		"Move to trash" => "Moure a la paperera",
		"Reject with error (do not save)" => "Rebutjar amb error (no desar)",
		"For effectiveness similar to dedicated anti-spam plugins, enable a cloud check. Local rules still run as a second layer." => "Per a una eficàcia similar als plugins anti-spam dedicats, activeu una comprovació al núvol. Les regles locals continuen com a segona capa.",
		"Cloud mode" => "Mode al núvol",
		"Off (local rules only)" => "Desactivat (només regles locals)",
		"Akismet (requires Akismet plugin + API key)" => "Akismet (requereix el plugin Akismet + clau API)",
		"Akismet plugin is not active. Install and configure Akismet or choose another mode." => "El plugin Akismet no està actiu. Instal·leu i configureu Akismet o trieu un altre mode.",
		"CleanTalk access key" => "Clau d'accés CleanTalk",
		"Only used when Cloud mode is CleanTalk. You can reuse your existing CleanTalk key without keeping their plugin active." => "Només s'utilitza quan el mode al núvol és CleanTalk. Podeu reutilitzar la vostra clau CleanTalk sense mantenir el seu plugin actiu.",
		"Min. confidence (%)" => "Confiança mínima (%)",
