		"No calls yet" => "Encara sense consultes",
		"%s ago" => "fa %s",
		"Add this IP to the whitelist? It will skip every anti-spam rule from now on." => "Afegir aquesta IP a la whitelist? A partir d'ara se saltarà totes les regles antispam.",
		"Allow IP" => "Permetre IP",
